                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "void cmpCountSort(int a[],int b[],int n)\n{   int i,j,*count;\n    count=(int *)malloc(sizeof(int)*n);  //C++语言: count=new int[n];\n    for(i=0;i<n;i++)  count[i]=0;\n    for(i=0;i<n-1;i++)\n        for(j=i+1;j<n;j++)\n            if(a[i]<a[j])  count[j]++;\n            else  count[i]++;\n    for(i=0;i<n;i++)  b[count[i]]= a[i];\n    free(count);  //C++语言: delete count;\n}"
                    }
