                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "A. p->next->prev = p->prev; p->prev->next = p->prev; free(p);\nB. p->next->prev = p->next; p->prev->next = p->next; free(p);\nC. p->next->prev = p->next; p->prev->next = p->prev; free(p);\nD. p->next->prev = p->prev; p->prev->next = p->next; free(p);"
