                        "content": "//进程 P₁\n    int x = 0;\nThread1()\n    {   int a;\n        a = 1;  x += 1;\n    }\nThread2()\n    {   int a;\n        a = 2; x += 2;\n    }\n//进程 P₂\n    int x = 0;\nThread3()\n    {   int a;\n        a = x;  x += 3;\n    }\nThread4()\n    {   int b;\n        b = x; x += 4;\n    }"
